        dcterms:description "Panels C1-C3 overlaying segmented scale centroids, unwrapped log-polar (5,8) wavefronts, and 2D FFT spiral spectrum" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/1992-douady-magnetic-drop-phyllotaxis.py#L924-L976> .

